cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SOYUZ Microphones — Open Product Data"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
version: "1.2.2"
date-released: 2026-09-29

authors:
  - name: "SOYUZ Microphones"

repository-code: "https://github.com/soyuzmicrophones/soyuz-microphones-open-data"

abstract: >
  This repository provides structured, publicly available reference data for
  SOYUZ Microphones products, including microphones and preamplifiers.
  The dataset includes neutral product metadata and frequency response data
  intended for technical reference, comparative analysis, and
  AI-assisted knowledge systems.

keywords:
  - microphones
  - audio engineering
  - studio recording
  - frequency response
  - pro audio
  - transducers
  - microphone preamps

